### Feature Supply — CREATE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### CREATE -> 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/insumos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "INS-0100",
  "nombre": "Café en grano",
  "unidad_medida": "kg",
  "stock_minimo": 5
}

### CREATE con codigo repetido -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/insumos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "INS-0100",
  "nombre": "Otro insumo",
  "unidad_medida": "l"
}
